Id: rol001w
Severity: WARN
Category: accounts
Check: check_passwd
Controls: CIS 5.1, 5.2; NIST AC-2, IA-5(1); ISO 5.16, 5.17; CE User access control

root is a plain user when it should be a role: anyone
compromising its password gets an interactive login as root
instead of having to assume the role. Make root a role
(`usermod -K type=role root`) and give administrators their
own accounts with the root role assigned.
